  "notable_quotes": [
    "The diffusive skin effect may improve zeolite catalysis by increasing reactant contact and collisions with active sites rather than bulk-like transport.",
    "Methane diffusion in zeolites shows a universal diffusive skin effect: in more than 200 zeolites, molecules preferentially migrate along pore walls.",
    "Methane self-diffusion in zeolites at 300 K spans 10^-10 to 10^-8 m2/s, far slower than gas-phase diffusion of about 10^-5 m2/s."
